#: modules/core_render_options_panel/render_options_panel.tscn
msgid ""
"Group Of Pictures. Higher value is better for compression compared to a "
"lower value. But how higher the value is, the less precise it will get for "
"seeking and scrubbing through the video playback. Put to a low value if you "
"intend to use the rendered video for editing."
msgstr ""
"Group Of Pictures（图像组）。与较低的数值相比，较高的数值更有利于压缩。但数值"
"越高，视频播放时的定位和快进/快退操作就越不精确。如果您打算将渲染后的视频用于"
"编辑，建议将该数值调低。"

#: modules/core_render_options_panel/render_options_panel.tscn
msgid ""
"B-frames (Bi-directional predictive frames) improve compression and visual "
"quality by referencing both past and future frames. Higher values reduce "
"file size but increase encoding time and player decoding requirements. "
"Values between 2 and 4 are generally recommended."
msgstr ""

